// Secrets (Worker settings → Variables and Secrets, type "Secret"):
//   STRIPE_SECRET_KEY      sk_test_... while testing, sk_live_... when you launch
//   STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET  whsec_... from the Stripe webhook you create

